 "proxy-features": "<figure class=\"diagram\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The LiteLLM proxy as one shared gateway in a microservice system. On the left, your services, AI agents, off-the-shelf tools and admins call the proxy. Inside, every request first passes the policy layer: virtual keys, teams and single sign-on; budgets and rate limits; guardrails. It then reaches one of six gateways: the LLM API, the MCP gateway, the agent (A2A) gateway, the prompt registry, the skills store, and the memory and session store. Everything is recorded in spend logs, metrics and callbacks. On the right, the proxy calls LLM providers, MCP tool servers and A2A agents. Below, it keeps state in Postgres and Redis, reads provider keys from a secret manager, and sends logs and metrics to observability tools.\">\n<div class=\"diagram-scroll\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 480\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs><marker id=\"arr8\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"arrowhead\"/></marker></defs>\n  <g class=\"group\"><rect x=\"185\" y=\"10\" width=\"535\" height=\"385\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"452\" y=\"32\">LiteLLM proxy</text><text x=\"452\" y=\"48\" class=\"sub\">one gateway for every team \u00b7 several replicas behind a load balancer</text></g>\n  <g class=\"edges\">\n    <path d=\"M160,85 L198,85\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M160,165 C180,165 180,95 198,92\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M160,245 C185,245 185,100 198,98\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M160,325 C190,325 190,104 198,103\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M360,85 L373,85\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M533,85 L546,85\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M452,112 L452,138\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M452,302 L452,318\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M720,140 L748,140\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M720,215 L748,215\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M720,290 L748,290\" marker-end=\"url(#arr8)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M277,395 L277,418\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M452,395 L452,418\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M627,395 L627,418\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M720,370 C800,370 830,390 830,418\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"60\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"81\">Your services</text><text x=\"85\" y=\"98\" class=\"sub\">OpenAI/Anthropic SDKs</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"140\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"161\">AI agents</text><text x=\"85\" y=\"178\" class=\"sub\">MCP and A2A clients</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"220\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"241\">Tools</text><text x=\"85\" y=\"258\" class=\"sub\">IDEs, chat apps, curl</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"300\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"321\">Admins</text><text x=\"85\" y=\"338\" class=\"sub\">admin UI and API</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"200\" y=\"62\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"83\">Keys, teams, SSO</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"100\" class=\"sub\">who may call what</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"373\" y=\"62\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"453\" y=\"83\">Budgets, limits</text><text x=\"453\" y=\"100\" class=\"sub\">spend caps, rpm/tpm</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"546\" y=\"62\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"626\" y=\"83\">Guardrails</text><text x=\"626\" y=\"100\" class=\"sub\">mask or block content</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"200\" y=\"140\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"166\">LLM API</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"184\" class=\"sub mono\">/v1/chat/completions</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"199\" class=\"sub mono\">/v1/messages, \u2026</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"373\" y=\"140\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"453\" y=\"170\">MCP gateway</text><text x=\"453\" y=\"190\" class=\"sub mono\">/mcp</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"546\" y=\"140\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"626\" y=\"170\">Agent gateway</text><text x=\"626\" y=\"190\" class=\"sub mono\">/a2a (A2A)</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"200\" y=\"225\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"255\">Prompt registry</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"275\" class=\"sub mono\">/prompts</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"373\" y=\"225\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"453\" y=\"255\">Skills store</text><text x=\"453\" y=\"275\" class=\"sub mono\">/v1/skills</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"546\" y=\"225\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"626\" y=\"255\">Memory, sessions</text><text x=\"626\" y=\"275\" class=\"sub mono\">/v1/memory</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"200\" y=\"320\" width=\"506\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"453\" y=\"341\">Spend logs, metrics, callbacks</text><text x=\"453\" y=\"358\" class=\"sub\">per key, team, user and agent</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"750\" y=\"115\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"136\">LLM providers</text><text x=\"830\" y=\"153\" class=\"sub\">Anthropic, Bedrock, \u2026</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"750\" y=\"190\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"211\">MCP tool servers</text><text x=\"830\" y=\"228\" class=\"sub\">GitHub, Jira, your own</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"750\" y=\"265\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"286\">A2A agents</text><text x=\"830\" y=\"303\" class=\"sub\">any framework</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"200\" y=\"420\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"277\" y=\"441\">Postgres</text><text x=\"277\" y=\"458\" class=\"sub\">keys, spend, registries</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"375\" y=\"420\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"452\" y=\"441\">Redis</text><text x=\"452\" y=\"458\" class=\"sub\">shared limits, cache</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"550\" y=\"420\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"627\" y=\"441\">Secret manager</text><text x=\"627\" y=\"458\" class=\"sub\">provider keys</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"750\" y=\"420\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"441\">Observability</text><text x=\"830\" y=\"458\" class=\"sub\">OTel, Prometheus, \u2026</text></g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</figure>\n",
 "overview": "<figure class=\"diagram\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Architecture at a glance. Any client, such as the OpenAI or Anthropic SDK or curl, calls the LiteLLM proxy, also called the AI gateway, where virtual keys, budgets and rate limits are checked and hooks such as guardrails and skills run; the proxy keeps its state in Redis and Postgres. The proxy hands the request to the LiteLLM SDK: the Router does load balancing, retries and fallbacks, then completion() and the provider adapters translate the request and call the providers, such as Anthropic, OpenAI and Bedrock. Your own Python code can call the SDK directly, without the proxy.\">\n<div class=\"diagram-scroll\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs><marker id=\"arr4\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"arrowhead\"/></marker></defs>\n  <g class=\"group\"><rect x=\"205\" y=\"10\" width=\"210\" height=\"172\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"32\">LiteLLM proxy</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"48\" class=\"sub\">the AI gateway</text></g>\n  <g class=\"group\"><rect x=\"440\" y=\"88\" width=\"240\" height=\"228\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"560\" y=\"110\">LiteLLM SDK</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"126\" class=\"sub\">import litellm, or inside the proxy</text></g>\n  <g class=\"edges\">\n    <path d=\"M180,83 L218,83\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M310,106 L310,118\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M395,141 C425,141 425,168 453,168\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M180,298 C320,298 330,268 453,268\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M560,196 L560,238\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M665,268 L718,268\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M310,182 L310,204\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"55\" width=\"170\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"78\">Any client</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"96\" class=\"sub\">OpenAI/Anthropic SDK, curl</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"270\" width=\"170\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"293\">Your Python code</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"311\" class=\"sub\">calls the SDK directly</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"220\" y=\"60\" width=\"180\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"79\">Virtual keys</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"96\" class=\"sub\">budgets, rate limits</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"220\" y=\"118\" width=\"180\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"137\">Hooks</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"154\" class=\"sub\">guardrails, skills</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"220\" y=\"204\" width=\"180\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"223\">Redis + Postgres</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"240\" class=\"sub\">keys, counters, spend</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"455\" y=\"140\" width=\"210\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"560\" y=\"163\">Router</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"181\" class=\"sub\">load balancing, retries, fallbacks</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"455\" y=\"240\" width=\"210\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"560\" y=\"263\">completion()</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"281\" class=\"sub\">provider adapters translate</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"720\" y=\"240\" width=\"170\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"805\" y=\"263\">Providers</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"281\" class=\"sub\">Anthropic, Bedrock, \u2026</text></g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</figure>\n",
 "life": "<figure class=\"diagram\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The life of a request through the proxy. The client posts to /v1/chat/completions with a virtual key. The proxy checks in its cache, then Redis or Postgres, that the key is valid and under budget, then applies rate limits and pre-call hooks. It passes the model group to the Router, which picks one deployment for the SDK. The SDK's adapter sends the request to the provider in the provider's own format and gets the reply, which it returns to the proxy in OpenAI shape with its cost. The proxy returns the response with an x-litellm-response-cost header, and after the reply writes spend, logs and counters in the background.\">\n<div class=\"diagram-scroll\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 560\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs><marker id=\"arr5\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"arrowhead\"/></marker></defs>\n  <g class=\"edges\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 5\">\n    <path d=\"M70,54 L70,550\"/><path d=\"M230,54 L230,550\"/><path d=\"M390,54 L390,550\"/><path d=\"M550,54 L550,550\"/><path d=\"M710,54 L710,550\"/><path d=\"M855,54 L855,550\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"120\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"28\">Client</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">OpenAI format</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"165\" y=\"8\" width=\"130\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"28\">Proxy</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">auth, limits, hooks</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"325\" y=\"8\" width=\"130\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"28\">Router</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">model group</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"485\" y=\"8\" width=\"130\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"28\">SDK + adapter</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">translate, price</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"645\" y=\"8\" width=\"130\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"28\">Provider</text><text x=\"710\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">LLM API</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"795\" y=\"8\" width=\"120\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"855\" y=\"28\">Redis</text><text x=\"855\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">+ Postgres</text></g>\n  <g class=\"edges\">\n    <path d=\"M70,100 L228,100\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M230,150 L853,150\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M230,250 L388,250\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M390,290 L548,290\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M550,340 L708,340\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M710,380 L552,380\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M550,430 L232,430\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M230,480 L72,480\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M230,530 L853,530\" marker-end=\"url(#arr5)\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"150\" y=\"76\" class=\"lbl mono\">POST /v1/chat/completions</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"91\" class=\"lbl mono\">Bearer sk-\u2026 (virtual key)</text>\n  <text x=\"545\" y=\"141\" class=\"lbl\">key valid, under budget, model allowed? (memory cache first)</text>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"160\" y=\"172\" width=\"140\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"190\">rate limits</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"206\" class=\"sub\">pre-call hooks</text></g>\n  <text x=\"310\" y=\"241\" class=\"lbl mono\">model group \"chat\"</text>\n  <text x=\"470\" y=\"281\" class=\"lbl\">one deployment</text>\n  <text x=\"630\" y=\"331\" class=\"lbl\">provider's own format</text>\n  <text x=\"630\" y=\"371\" class=\"lbl\">reply</text>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"421\" class=\"lbl\">OpenAI shape + cost</text>\n  <text x=\"150\" y=\"456\" class=\"lbl\">response +</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"471\" class=\"lbl mono\">x-litellm-response-cost</text>\n  <text x=\"545\" y=\"521\" class=\"lbl\">after the reply: spend, logs, rate-limit counters</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</figure>\n",
 "router": "<figure class=\"diagram\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Inside the router. router.acompletion is wrapped first by the fallbacks wrapper, which moves to the next model group once retries are used up, and then by the retries wrapper, which retries a failed call on another deployment in the same group. The innermost call is litellm.acompletion on one deployment, which calls the provider.\">\n<div class=\"diagram-scroll\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs><marker id=\"arr6\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"arrowhead\"/></marker></defs>\n  <g class=\"edges\">\n    <path d=\"M185,98 L208,98\" marker-end=\"url(#arr6)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M370,98 L393,98\" marker-end=\"url(#arr6)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M570,98 L593,98\" marker-end=\"url(#arr6)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M780,98 L803,98\" marker-end=\"url(#arr6)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M687,126 C687,172 482,172 482,130\" marker-end=\"url(#arr6)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M482,70 C482,30 290,30 290,66\" marker-end=\"url(#arr6)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"70\" width=\"175\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"97\" y=\"93\" class=\"mono\">router.acompletion</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"111\" class=\"sub mono\">model=\"chat\"</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"210\" y=\"70\" width=\"160\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"93\">with fallbacks</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"111\" class=\"sub\">next model group</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"395\" y=\"70\" width=\"175\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"482\" y=\"93\">with retries</text><text x=\"482\" y=\"111\" class=\"sub\">same group, another try</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"595\" y=\"70\" width=\"185\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"687\" y=\"93\" class=\"mono\">litellm.acompletion</text><text x=\"687\" y=\"111\" class=\"sub\">one deployment</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"805\" y=\"70\" width=\"85\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"847\" y=\"102\">Provider</text></g>\n  <text x=\"585\" y=\"186\" class=\"lbl\">error \u2192 retry (num_retries)</text>\n  <text x=\"386\" y=\"24\" class=\"lbl\">retries used up \u2192 fall back</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</figure>\n",
 "sha:958d70a09dc1": "<figure class=\"diagram\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sequence of one request through the proxy to Bedrock: the app posts to the proxy server with a virtual key; the server checks the key, picks a deployment and calls the litellm SDK, where the Bedrock adapter maps the parameters and builds the Converse body, gets AWS credentials from the boto3 chain or STS, and posts to Bedrock signed with SigV4; the adapter turns Bedrock's reply or error into OpenAI shape and returns a priced ModelResponse; the server records spend and returns an OpenAI-shaped response with x-litellm headers.\">\n<div class=\"diagram-scroll\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 615\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs><marker id=\"arr2\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"arrowhead\"/></marker></defs>\n  <g class=\"edges\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 5\">\n    <path d=\"M80,54 L80,605\"/><path d=\"M300,54 L300,605\"/><path d=\"M500,54 L500,605\"/><path d=\"M690,54 L690,605\"/><path d=\"M845,54 L845,605\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"140\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"28\">Any app</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">OpenAI client</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"225\" y=\"8\" width=\"150\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"28\">Proxy server</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">config.yaml</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"410\" y=\"8\" width=\"180\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"28\">Bedrock adapter</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">inside the litellm SDK</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"615\" y=\"8\" width=\"150\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"690\" y=\"28\">AWS credentials</text><text x=\"690\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">boto3 chain / STS</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"780\" y=\"8\" width=\"130\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"845\" y=\"28\">AWS Bedrock</text><text x=\"845\" y=\"45\" class=\"sub\">your AWS account</text></g>\n  <g class=\"edges\">\n    <path d=\"M80,102 L298,102\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M300,204 L498,204\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M500,290 L688,290\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M690,324 L502,324\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M500,372 L843,372\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M845,406 L502,406\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M500,492 L302,492\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M300,594 L82,594\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"190\" y=\"78\" class=\"lbl mono\">POST /v1/chat/completions</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"93\" class=\"lbl mono\">model=chat \u00b7 Bearer sk-\u2026</text>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"225\" y=\"116\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"133\">check the key</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"148\" class=\"sub\">alias \u2192 deployment</text></g>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"180\" class=\"lbl mono\">completion(model=</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"195\" class=\"lbl mono\">\"bedrock/us.anthropic\u2026\")</text>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"390\" y=\"218\" width=\"220\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"235\">build the request</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"250\" class=\"sub\">map params \u2192 Converse body</text></g>\n  <text x=\"595\" y=\"282\" class=\"lbl\">get credentials</text>\n  <text x=\"595\" y=\"316\" class=\"lbl\">temporary keys (cached)</text>\n  <text x=\"672\" y=\"348\" class=\"lbl mono\">POST /model/us.anthropic\u2026/converse</text><text x=\"672\" y=\"363\" class=\"lbl\">SigV4, signed for us-west-2</text>\n  <text x=\"672\" y=\"398\" class=\"lbl\">Converse reply, or ThrottlingException</text>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"390\" y=\"420\" width=\"220\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"437\">translate the reply</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"452\" class=\"sub\">OpenAI shape, or RateLimitError</text></g>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"484\" class=\"lbl mono\">ModelResponse + cost</text>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"225\" y=\"506\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"523\">record spend</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"538\" class=\"sub\">key, team, user</text></g>\n  <text x=\"190\" y=\"570\" class=\"lbl mono\">200 chat.completion</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"585\" class=\"lbl mono\">+ x-litellm-* headers</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</figure>\n",
 "sha:d6ab59c6ef08": "<figure class=\"diagram\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Four setups. In the SDK setup, your Python app holds the API key or AWS identity; the litellm core hands each call to the Anthropic adapter, which calls the Anthropic API with an x-api-key header, or to the Bedrock adapter, which calls AWS Bedrock with a SigV4 signature. In the proxy setup, any app sends an OpenAI request and a virtual key to the LiteLLM proxy; the proxy server checks the key, picks a deployment and hands the call to the same two adapters, and the proxy holds the API key or AWS identity.\">\n<div class=\"diagram-scroll\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 440\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs><marker id=\"arr3\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"arrowhead\"/></marker></defs>\n  <g class=\"group\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"550\" height=\"200\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"285\" y=\"32\">Your Python app (SDK)</text><text x=\"285\" y=\"50\" class=\"sub\">import litellm \u00b7 this process holds the API key or AWS identity</text></g>\n  <g class=\"group\"><rect x=\"150\" y=\"230\" width=\"410\" height=\"200\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"355\" y=\"252\">LiteLLM proxy</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"270\" class=\"sub\">config.yaml \u00b7 the proxy holds the API key or AWS identity</text></g>\n  <g class=\"edges\">\n    <path d=\"M290,95 L308,95\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M290,165 L308,165\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M135,350 L163,350\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M290,315 L308,315\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M290,385 L308,385\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M545,95 C620,95 610,140 678,140\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M545,165 C615,165 610,310 678,310\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M545,315 C615,315 610,160 678,160\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M545,385 C620,385 610,340 678,340\" marker-end=\"url(#arr3)\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"65\" width=\"265\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"157\" y=\"113\">litellm core</text><text x=\"157\" y=\"133\" class=\"sub mono\">completion(), Router</text><text x=\"157\" y=\"150\" class=\"sub\">cost, callbacks</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"310\" y=\"65\" width=\"235\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"427\" y=\"86\">Anthropic adapter</text><text x=\"427\" y=\"103\" class=\"sub mono\">AnthropicConfig</text><text x=\"427\" y=\"118\" class=\"sub\">API key \u2192 x-api-key</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"310\" y=\"135\" width=\"235\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"427\" y=\"156\">Bedrock adapter</text><text x=\"427\" y=\"173\" class=\"sub mono\">AmazonConverseConfig</text><text x=\"427\" y=\"188\" class=\"sub\">AWS credentials \u2192 SigV4</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"315\" width=\"125\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"343\">Any app</text><text x=\"72\" y=\"361\" class=\"sub\">OpenAI client</text><text x=\"72\" y=\"376\" class=\"sub\">+ virtual key</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"165\" y=\"285\" width=\"125\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"227\" y=\"330\">Proxy server</text><text x=\"227\" y=\"350\" class=\"sub\">key check</text><text x=\"227\" y=\"366\" class=\"sub\">alias \u2192 deployment</text><text x=\"227\" y=\"382\" class=\"sub\">record spend</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"310\" y=\"285\" width=\"235\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"427\" y=\"306\">Anthropic adapter</text><text x=\"427\" y=\"323\" class=\"sub mono\">AnthropicConfig</text><text x=\"427\" y=\"338\" class=\"sub\">API key \u2192 x-api-key</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"310\" y=\"355\" width=\"235\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"427\" y=\"376\">Bedrock adapter</text><text x=\"427\" y=\"393\" class=\"sub mono\">AmazonConverseConfig</text><text x=\"427\" y=\"408\" class=\"sub\">AWS credentials \u2192 SigV4</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"680\" y=\"120\" width=\"210\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"785\" y=\"144\">Anthropic API</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"164\" class=\"sub mono\">api.anthropic.com</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"680\" y=\"290\" width=\"210\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"785\" y=\"314\">AWS Bedrock</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"332\" class=\"sub mono\">bedrock-runtime.&lt;region&gt;</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"348\" class=\"sub\">your AWS account</text></g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</figure>\n",
 "memory": "<figure class=\"diagram\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Reference architecture for context and memory around a stateless LLM. On the read path, the user's message goes to an orchestrator, which asks a retriever for candidates from the memory stores; the context assembler fits the best of them into the token budget, ordered for caching, and the LLM answers. In the agent loop the LLM calls tools, including a memory tool, which can read and write the stores mid-turn. On the write path, after the reply, a background step extracts and consolidates what to keep and writes it to the stores: the session store holds recent turns and a summary, the long-term store holds episodic and semantic memories, and the procedural store holds prompts, skills and tool definitions.\">\n<div class=\"diagram-scroll\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 365\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs><marker id=\"arr7\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"arrowhead\"/></marker></defs>\n  <g class=\"group\"><rect x=\"150\" y=\"238\" width=\"600\" height=\"118\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"260\">Memory stores (outside the model)</text></g>\n  <g class=\"edges\">\n    <path d=\"M130,65 L158,65\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M300,65 L328,65\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M500,65 L528,65\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M670,65 L708,65\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M230,90 L230,148\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M300,175 C370,175 415,140 415,92\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M230,238 L230,202\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M585,90 L585,148\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M615,148 L615,92\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M600,200 L600,236\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\" marker-start=\"url(#arr7)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M800,90 L800,148\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M800,200 C800,300 790,308 752,308\" marker-end=\"url(#arr7)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"40\" width=\"120\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"61\">User message</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"78\" class=\"sub\">this turn</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"160\" y=\"40\" width=\"140\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"61\">Orchestrator</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"78\" class=\"sub\">your app</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"330\" y=\"40\" width=\"170\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"61\">Context assembler</text><text x=\"415\" y=\"78\" class=\"sub\">budget, order, cache</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node accent\"><rect x=\"530\" y=\"40\" width=\"140\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"61\">LLM</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"78\" class=\"sub\">stateless</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"710\" y=\"40\" width=\"180\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"61\">Reply</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"78\" class=\"sub\">to the user</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"160\" y=\"150\" width=\"140\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"171\">Retriever</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"188\" class=\"sub\">many candidates</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"530\" y=\"150\" width=\"140\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"171\">Tools</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"188\" class=\"sub\">incl. a memory tool</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"710\" y=\"150\" width=\"180\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"171\">Extract, consolidate</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"188\" class=\"sub\">in the background</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"165\" y=\"285\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"255\" y=\"308\">Session store</text><text x=\"255\" y=\"326\" class=\"sub\">recent turns, summary</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"360\" y=\"285\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"308\">Long-term store</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"326\" class=\"sub\">episodic, semantic</text></g>\n  <g class=\"node\"><rect x=\"555\" y=\"285\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><text x=\"645\" y=\"308\">Procedural</text><text x=\"645\" y=\"326\" class=\"sub\">prompts, skills, tools</text></g>\n  <text x=\"372\" y=\"140\" class=\"lbl\">best few</text>\n  <text x=\"190\" y=\"224\" class=\"lbl\">read path</text>\n  <text x=\"652\" y=\"224\" class=\"lbl\">agent loop</text>\n  <text x=\"845\" y=\"250\" class=\"lbl\">write path</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</figure>\n"
}